    },
    {
     "name": "UNWAVERING PHALANX",
     "text": "WHEN: Your opponent\u2019s Charge phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Charge move.\nTARGET: One Rubric Marines unit from your army within Engagement Range of that enemy unit.\nEFFECT: Until the end of the turn, attacks that target your unit with a S greater than your unit\u2019s T have -1 to wound rolls."
